a purpose. And if the world has truly fallen\u2026 then someone has to save it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/15f78be96664d56e7266a3c83b72e93d.poster.avif?t=1749070897\" width=620 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/15f78be96664d56e7266a3c83b72e93d.webm?t=1749070897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/15f78be96664d56e7266a3c83b72e93d.mp4?t=1749070897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique close-combat system has been designed to make every encounter intense and dangerous. Even the simplest zombies are now formidable threats. With only a kitchen knife as your main weapon, combat takes place at a dangerously close distance. Experience a classic combat system where every move matters.</p>",
